# Built service bundles. Generated by 01-bundle-routes.sh from stack source and
# copied here; the sidecar mounts them but does not author them. Kept out of the
# repository for the same reason the reload discipline exists — a committed
# bundle is a snapshot of code this directory does not contain, and the build
# marker in the handshake is what makes the difference visible at runtime. The
# release step that produces the plugin is where they get attached.
services/*.mjs
services/data/
node_modules/
.session/
